source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Manage personal categories independently of provider labels

Usage: mxr categories [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  create
  rename
  show
  assign  Preview selected message assignments, or apply them with a preview token
  delete  Preview deletion, or confirm the exact preview with its token
  undo
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --account <ACCOUNT>
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
